{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09209","headline":"荅长安丞裴说 · 韦应物","name":"荅长安丞裴说","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出身忝时士，於世本无机。\n爰以林壑趣，遂成顽钝姿。\n临流意已凄，采菊露未稀。\n举头见秋山，万事都若遗。\n独践幽人踪，邈将亲友违。\n髦士佐京邑，怀念枉贞词。\n久雨积幽抱，清罇宴良知。\n从容操剧务，文翰方见推。\n安能戢羽翼，顾此林栖时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09209.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09209","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}